#
# webui templates use html/template, which auto-escapes all dynamic values.
# The generic.html-templates.security.unquoted-attribute-var rule cannot
# distinguish html/template (context-aware auto-escaping, safe) from raw
# text/template (unsafe). The flagged attributes (e.g.
# class="{{ if eq .ActiveView "status" }}nav-active{{ end }}") render only
# static, compile-time string literals into the attribute — no user-controlled
# value reaches the attribute. unquoted-attribute-var is a verified
# false-positive for these html/template files (SEC-02, RESEARCH Pitfall 5).
